<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f7f9;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669 0%, #10b981 100%);
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            color: #ffffff;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 40px;
            color: #334155;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .greeting {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .order-number {
            background-color: #f0fdf4;
            border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 16px;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .order-number span {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #059669;
        }
        .items-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .items-table th {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #64748b;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }
        .items-table td {
            padding: 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
        }
        .total-row {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 18px;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
        }
        .tracking-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #059669;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 14px 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>🎉 ¡Pedido Confirmado!</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p class="greeting">Hola <strong>{{customerName}}</strong>,</p>
            <p>¡Gracias por tu compra! Hemos recibido tu pedido y está siendo procesado.</p>
            
            <div class="order-number">
                <span>{{orderNumber}}</span>
                <p style="margin: 8px 0 0 0; color: #64748b;">{{placedAt}}</p>
            </div>

            <h3 style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Resumen del pedido</h3>
            <table class="items-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Producto</th>
                        <th>SKU</th>
                        <th style="text-align: center;">Cant.</th>
                        <th style="text-align: right;">Total</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each items}}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{productName}}</td>
                        <td style="color: #64748b; font-size: 12px;">{{productSku}}</td>
                        <td style="text-align: center;">{{quantity}}</td>
                        <td style="text-align: right;">S/ {{lineTotal}}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                    <tr class="total-row">
                        <td colspan="3" style="text-align: right;">Total:</td>
                        <td style="text-align: right;">S/ {{total}}</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>

            {{#if isCashOnDelivery}}
            <div style="background-color:#fffbeb; border:2px solid #fde68a; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin:20px 0;">
                <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-weight:700; font-size:16px;">💵 Pago Contra Entrega</p>
                {{#if cashOnDeliveryInstructions}}
                <p style="margin:0; color:#92400e;">{{cashOnDeliveryInstructions}}</p>
                {{else}}
                <p style="margin:0; color:#92400e;">Pagarás <strong>S/ {{total}}</strong> al momento de recibir tu pedido. Ten el monto exacto listo para el repartidor.</p>
                {{/if}}
            </div>
            {{/if}}

            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="{{trackingUrl}}" class="tracking-button">📦 Seguir tu pedido</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            &copy; 2026 Werd. Todos los derechos reservados.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>